{"id":"38a6929b52694b0f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems.md","title":"CFG 的歧义、交、全称、等价、包含与正则性问题","display":"df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems — CFG 的歧义、交、全称、等价、包含与正则性问题","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems","aliases":["73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems"],"display":"df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems — CFG 的歧义、交、全称、等价、包含与正则性问题","depends_on":["[[73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code]]","[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.2–9.5.4, Theorems 9.20–9.22 and Exercise 9.5.2, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems — CFG 的歧义、交、全称、等价、包含与正则性问题"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3d01ee2a38f6e35\" href=\"?note=a3d01ee2a38f6e35\" title=\"73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code\">73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.2–9.5.4, Theorems 9.20–9.22 and Exercise 9.5.2, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\">\\(G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G=\\pi_2(G)\">\\(\\Sigma_G=\\pi_2(G)\\)</span>；配对编码为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairBits}\">\\(\\operatorname{PairBits}\\)</span>。本条各集合仅含合法代码；两文法问题还要求终结字母表相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AMBCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AMBCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{INTCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)\\cap L(H)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{INTCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)\\cap L(H)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UNIVCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land L(G)=\\Sigma_G^*\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{UNIVCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land L(G)=\\Sigma_G^*\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EQCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)=L(H)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EQCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)=L(H)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{INCLCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)\\subseteq L(H)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{INCLCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)\\subseteq L(H)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{REGCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land L(G)\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma_G}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{REGCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land L(G)\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma_G}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>区分“某一词是否在语言中”与“整个文法语言的语义性质”。两文法问题的非法码、不同字母表码均拒绝，因此是定义在全部二进制输入上的精确语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code","status":"resolved","id":"a3d01ee2a38f6e35","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}$，$\\Sigma_G=\\pi_2(G)$；配对编码为 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]] 的 $\\operatorname{PairBits}$。本条各集合仅含合法代码；两文法问题还要求终结字母表相同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G=\\pi_2(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairBits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AMBCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{INTCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)\\cap L(H)\\ne\\varnothing\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{UNIVCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land L(G)=\\Sigma_G^*\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EQCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)=L(H)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{INCLCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G),\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)):\nG,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG},\\ \\pi_2(G)=\\pi_2(H),\\ L(G)\\subseteq L(H)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{REGCFG}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\land L(G)\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma_G}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2241,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems|CFG 的歧义、交、全称、等价、包含与正则性问题]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"0c6487c88a983213","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"378dfa121b0216f8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"六种二进制语言采用 [[73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems]] 的代码与字母表条件。"}],"outgoing":["a3d01ee2a38f6e35","a3d61b5dd7be385b","c284ffb568a496fd","bc88ca69b33d5036"]}